hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2776","###\n Ya'qub ibn Ibrahim ad-Dawraqi narrated to us, saying: Abdur-Rahman ibn Mahdi narrated to us, from Malik.\nAnd Yahya ibn Hakim narrated to us, saying: Abdur-Rahman ibn Mahdi narrated to us, from Malik.\nAnd Yahya ibn Hakim also narrated to us, saying: Bishr ibn Umar narrated to us, saying: Malik narrated to us, from Muhammad ibn Abdur-Rahman ibn Nawfal,"
